  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components thoroughly and autoclave. After cooling, add the following solutions (filter-sterilized) to the medium:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Then, distribute the medium into culture vessels (leave >80% gas phase, by volume) and seal with butyl rubber stoppers. Replace the gas phase with N2-CO2-CH4-O2 (40:15:40:5, by volume) and pressurize to 100 kPa with the same gas mixture. Check final pH of the medium to be around 6.0."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Dissolve nitrilotriacetic acid and adjust pH to 6.5 with KOH. Then proceed to add minerals. Adjust final pH to 7.0."
    }
  ]
}